      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "100% this.\n\nOne is bound to eventually crash in VRChat. It would be awesome to have the last calibration including offsets and all that save not just across instances, but sessions as well.\n\nMost of the functionality is already there, all that is missing is to persist that data when updated and apply it on game boot.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
