  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-04-29T11:13:41.664Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I am not going to stand up to calibrate when I was comfortably lying down. If I crash and am that comfortable, I just give up on VRChat for the time being, even though there's friends I would have rather stayed with.\nFollowing a crash and quickly restarting VRChat, trackers are not going to be aligned any differently.",
